'''Team Rocket Grunt''' (Japanese: '''ロケット団のしたっぱ''' ''Rocket Gang Underling'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Flip a coin until you get tails. For each heads, discard a random Energy from your opponent's Active Pokémon.
}}

