==Trivia==
* This card's effect is similar to the effects of {{TCG|Crushing Hammer}} and {{TCG|Energy Removal 2}} in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]], but this is a {{TCGP|Supporter card}} (rather than an {{TCGP|Item card}}) that applies the same effect until it gets tails, and does not choose which Energy is discarded.
** {{TCG|Minion of Team Rocket}}—a card whose Japanese name matches the Team Rocket Grunts in the Generation I games, although has a different name to this card—also exists in the Pokémon Trading Card Game, but has a different effect.

===Origin===
*[[Team Rocket Grunt (Trainer class)|Team Rocket Grunt]]s are members of [[Team Rocket]]. Male and female grunts, as depicted in {{game|FireRed and LeafGreen|s}}, are depicted in this card's illustrations.

